      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "text": "53. 塑性形变的机构"
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0131#6",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "body_rows": 1,
      "wrap_markers": 0,
      "effective_rows": 1,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "text": "晶体弹性形变时，原子彼此只有很小的移动."
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0131#7",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "body_rows": 3,
      "wrap_markers": 0,
      "effective_rows": 3,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "text": "当塑性形变时，原子或分子的位移可以超过它们之间距离很多倍. 然而，没有破坏物体的晶体结构."
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0131#8",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "body_rows": 5,
      "wrap_markers": 0,
      "effective_rows": 5,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "text": "晶体点阵的各个层相对稍微滑动. 受到拉伸的单晶体如图91 а 所示. 可以很明显地看到各层滑动的痕迹. 各层滑动的过程如图91 б 所示."
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0131#9",
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 91",
      "body_rows": 0,
      "wrap_markers": 0,
      "effective_rows": 0,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0131#10",
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 91",
      "body_rows": 1,
      "wrap_markers": 0,
      "effective_rows": 1,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "text": "图 91"
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0131#11",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "body_rows": 3,
      "wrap_markers": 0,
      "effective_rows": 2,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": true,
      "text": "所有的晶体原子层的滑动是在个别部分开始，而不是在整个晶体的所有体积中，它们是在由于某种原因晶格点阵强度很小的地方开始. 例如，在点"
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0131#12",
